# Morrowind Temple: Tharer Rotheloth's "Cure Lette" (TT_CuringTouch). In the Molag Mar Temple Tharer Rotheloth sends
# the player to cure the Redguard Lette in Tel Mora of swamp fever ("Lette": 10). She lets the player try ("Swamp
# Fever": "Yes. I'd like to try." 2, then "I offer you this potion." 4: RemoveSpell); BILL_TT_Lette logs 50 once
# GetCommonDisease is 0. Tharer Rotheloth rewards the cure (100, a Restoration book).
# PositionCell and Position stand in for the travel, AddItem for buying the cure common disease potion.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_sanctusshrine_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_curingtouch_start
run
player->PositionCell 378 -280 3 0 "Molag Mar, Temple"
until 600 "tharer rotheloth"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tharer rotheloth
ask duties
ask Lette
expect GetJournalIndex TT_CuringTouch == 10
bye
end

case tt_curingtouch_lette
run
player->AddItem "p_cure_common_s" 1
player->Position 109901 121700 82 0
until 900 "lette"->GetDistance player < 4000
wait 120
talk lette
ask Swamp Fever
choose 2
choose 4
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_CuringTouch == 50
bye
end

case tt_curingtouch_done
run
player->PositionCell 378 -280 3 0 "Molag Mar, Temple"
until 600 "tharer rotheloth"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tharer rotheloth
ask Lette
expect GetJournalIndex TT_CuringTouch == 100
bye
end
